    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i get that ur not a doctor but i'm just trying to figure out if it's even worth the trip to the clinic. if i start high doses of the oregano oil and cranberry extract right now, is there a real chance it'll clear up on its own? i've read a lot of stuff online saying oregano oil is basically as strong as ciprofloxacin for mild cases. if i do that, do i really risk it getting worse?",
