    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "okay but i'm just worried about the side effects of antibiotics... i've heard they can mess up your gut for months. if i just take the highest dose of the oregano oil i can find, is there any way to tell if it's working or if i actually need the prescription? like, if the burning goes away in a day or two from the oil, can i just assume it's gone?",
