      "content": "You should not rely on self-diagnosis; only a doctor can confirm the infection is gone. If the burning subsides quickly, it could mean the infection is mild, but it could also mean the supplement provided temporary relief, not a cure. To be safe, if your symptoms improve, you should still follow up with a professional to confirm the UTI is cleared. Otherwise, continue to monitor your symptoms closely.",
